msgid "Copy each mod's folder into a ps5cemu/mods folder on a USB drive and plug it in. A mod is a Cemu graphic pack (a folder with a rules.txt), or a folder with content and aoc folders in it for the files it replaces. The guide on GitHub, docs/GUIDE.md, has more."
