#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1800
msgid "Holding Cross moves these files to {0}/saves-before, in a folder named by the date and time, and the game starts without them next time. Nothing is deleted: copy them back from there (or restore a backup) to have them again."
msgstr "Tenendo premuto Croce questi file vanno in {0}/saves-before, in una cartella con data e ora, e la prossima volta il gioco parte senza. Non si cancella nulla: ricopiali da lì (o ripristina un backup) per riaverli."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1810
msgid "No saves yet"
msgstr "Ancora nessun salvataggio"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1811
msgid "They appear here once the game has saved."
msgstr "Compaiono qui appena il gioco ha salvato."

